# Motoko Backend Engineering Standards

## Skills in this set

| Skill | Load when |
|---|---|
| `writingMotoko` | Writing or reviewing any `.mo` file |
| `testingMotoko` | Writing or running tests, verifying upgrade persistence |
| `cyclesAndCost` | Optimizing, choosing query vs update, sizing runway |
| `ledgerIntegration` | Code that holds or moves ICP |
| `internetIdentityAuth` | Login, delegations, session restore |
| `migratingMotoko` | Inline migration, no `--enhanced-migration` |
| `migratingMotokoEnhanced` | `migrations/` directory projects |
| `deployGuide` | Building, deploying, upgrading — read `deployGuide/SKILL.md` first |
| `buildAndTest`, `bumpPocketIc`, `bumpRustNightly` | Only inside the dfinity/motoko compiler repo |

## IcFalcon project skills (parent folder)

